WEBVTT

00:00:12.582 --> 00:00:16.127
VOLDEMORT:
You have fought valiantly...

00:00:17.545 --> 00:00:20.298
...but in vain.

00:00:23.593 --> 00:00:25.970
I do not wish this.

00:00:26.012 --> 00:00:31.684
Every drop of magical blood spilled
is a terrible waste.

00:00:31.726 --> 00:00:36.606
I therefore command my forces to retreat.

00:00:36.648 --> 00:00:42.195
In their absence,
dispose of your dead with dignity.

00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:48.868
Harry Potter, I now speak directly to you.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:54.415
On this night, you have allowed
your friends to die for you...

00:00:54.457 --> 00:00:57.085
...rather than face me yourself.

00:00:57.126 --> 00:01:00.797
There is no greater dishonor.

00:01:00.838 --> 00:01:05.843
Join me in the Forbidden Forest
and confront your fate.

00:01:07.053 --> 00:01:09.806
If you do not do this...

00:01:09.847 --> 00:01:16.646
...I shall kill every last man,
woman and child...

00:01:16.688 --> 00:01:21.275
...who tries to conceal you from me.

00:01:40.837 --> 00:01:42.755
HERMIONE:
Where is everybody?

00:02:07.572 --> 00:02:08.573
Harry.

00:02:14.245 --> 00:02:17.165
SPROUT: Oh, come on.
What's the matter with you?

00:02:17.206 --> 00:02:18.833
TRELAWNEY:
Oh, she's passed.

00:02:20.626 --> 00:02:23.129
There, she's gone.

00:02:31.095 --> 00:02:33.264
[SOBBING]

00:04:31.883 --> 00:04:33.009
PETUNIA:
Freak!

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.677
Come here.

00:04:34.719 --> 00:04:36.929
I'm gonna tell Mummy. You're a freak.

00:04:36.971 --> 00:04:39.515
You're a freak, Lily!

00:04:39.557 --> 00:04:41.183
Come here.

00:05:02.163 --> 00:05:05.583
SNAPE: She's jealous because
she's ordinary and you're special.

00:05:05.625 --> 00:05:08.169
LILY:
That's mean, Severus.

00:05:22.141 --> 00:05:23.976
[LILY LAUGHING]

00:05:30.983 --> 00:05:33.194
SORTING HAT:
Gryffindor!

00:05:33.235 --> 00:05:35.321
[STUDENTS APPLAUDING]

00:05:40.618 --> 00:05:43.537
-Hi. I'm James.
-Hi. I'm Lily.

00:05:48.125 --> 00:05:52.380
SNAPE:
Just like your father. Lazy. Arrogant.

00:05:52.421 --> 00:05:54.256
HARRY:
Don't say a word against my father.

00:06:00.554 --> 00:06:02.264
TRELAWNEY:
Blood shall be spilt...

00:06:02.306 --> 00:06:07.436
...and servant and master
shall be reunited once more.

00:06:07.478 --> 00:06:09.397
VOLDEMORT:
Severus.

00:06:10.481 --> 00:06:12.608
SNAPE:
No. Don't kill me.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:16.612
DUMBLEDORE:
The prophecy did not refer to a woman.

00:06:16.654 --> 00:06:19.031
It spoke of a boy born at the end of July.

00:06:19.073 --> 00:06:21.325
Yes, but he thinks it's her son.

00:06:21.909 --> 00:06:25.204
He intends to hunt them down now,
to kill them.

00:06:25.246 --> 00:06:29.875
Hide her. Hide them all. I beg you.

00:06:29.917 --> 00:06:33.004
DUMBLEDORE: What will you give me
in exchange, Severus?

00:06:34.755 --> 00:06:35.923
Anything.

00:06:35.965 --> 00:06:40.678
LILY:
Harry. Harry, you are so loved. So loved.

00:06:41.679 --> 00:06:44.473
Harry, Mama loves you.

00:06:44.515 --> 00:06:46.392
Dada loves you.

00:06:48.477 --> 00:06:50.604
Harry, be safe.

00:06:50.646 --> 00:06:51.814
Be strong.

00:06:51.856 --> 00:06:53.482
VOLDEMORT:
Avada Kedavra!

00:06:53.524 --> 00:06:55.317
[SCREAMS]

00:06:57.862 --> 00:07:02.450
SNAPE:
You said you would keep her safe.

00:07:02.491 --> 00:07:06.537
DUMBLEDORE: Lily and James put
their faith in the wrong person, Severus.

00:07:07.496 --> 00:07:09.540
Rather like you.

00:07:11.709 --> 00:07:13.294
The boy survives.

00:07:13.335 --> 00:07:15.713
He doesn't need protection.
The Dark Lord is gone.

00:07:15.755 --> 00:07:18.132
The Dark Lord will return.

00:07:18.174 --> 00:07:21.719
And when he does,
the boy will be in terrible danger.

00:07:22.928 --> 00:07:25.264
He has her eyes.

